<!--
  High contrast light: Black on white, 7:1 text, solid borders.
  GENERATED by tools/CoraTokenImport from CORA 827a1ac3 (tokens/themes/hc-light.css).
  Re-run the importer rather than editing this file. Accents keep CORA's operation meanings (§17.1):
